/-- **Simon Ch. 1, Upper Density Theorem 3.6** (cited fact (H2) of the a.e. tangent-plane proof),
in Mathlib's normalization `Hⁿ = μHE[n]`: if `A ⊆ ℝ^{n+ℓ}` is Borel and `ν(A) < ∞`, then
